*** Settings ***
Documentation     [SUITE PURPOSE]  verification of 5GC001527-A feature in the case of Classical FR2 L1Bypass
...               Prerequisite : GNB and Airphone should be installed
...               Scope : Reach a cell setup state, and perfom basic tests :
...                       SgNB addition, SSB position in burst checks
...                       UE attach, UL/DL traffic
...
...               Test Case Scenario author   : laurent.puchelle@nokia.com
...               Test Case Scenario contact  : yann.ah.herve@nokia.com
...               Creation Date               : 02-June-2021
...               Modified Date               : 14-Nov-2021
...               Last Modified by            : otilia.mihon@nokia.com


Resource                            ./resources/robot/5GC001527-A_3GPP_09-2019_ET_keywords.robot

Force Tags                          CA_5G_SW_FR-Villarceaux    RRM 
...   PY36
...                                 CONFIGURED    5G_RAN    RAN_5G    CRT
...                                 CLOUD_5G_I_LO_AP_LO_NSA_FS_ECPRI_MMWV_TDD    master_classicalbts_all
...                                 SBTS00    SBTS23R1    SBTS22R4

Suite Setup                         Suite Setup from scratch          ${FD_ALL}
Suite Teardown                      Suite Teardown
Test Teardown                       Run Keyword If Test Failed        Set 1527 failed

*** Variables ***
${TestSharkTool}	MC_SHARK


*** Test Cases ***
[1][1.0] 5GC001527_A_full_FR2

    [Setup]                   Run Keywords
    1527_A_CellSetup          classicalFR2


    
    1527_A_Attach             classicalFR2


    
    1527_A_DL



    1527_A_UL



    UE Detach Enb             ueSetting=${UE_SIMPLE}



    1527_A_getCounter





    Check 1527 Cell Setup     classicalFR2






    Check 1527 Attach         classicalFR2
    1527_A_check_counters     5GC001527_A_cell_setup
    1527_A_check_counters     5GC001527_A_attach




    1527_A_check_counters     5GC001527_A_DL_Traffic





    1527_A_check_counters     5GC001527_A_UL_Traffic



    Run Keyword If                  ${enable_sherpa} == ${True}             Sherpa.Deactivate Sherpa and Stop Collect
    Dated Log                     ${1527color}=== 1527 status: ${1527_status} ${defColor}
    Should be true                "${1527_status}"=="PASSED"
    [Teardown]                    setup.Test Teardown
